                                    179+*/*01* SIZE:                                                         */                     
                                    180+*/*     Prefix: 256 bytes                                            */                     
                                    181+*/*     CVT: 1280 bytes                                              */                     
                                    182+*/*     Virtual storage address extension: 80 bytes                  */                     
                                    183+*/*     OS - OS/VS common extension: 12 bytes                        */                     
